Updated @kitconcept/volto-plate to 1.0.0-alpha.43, on Plone Aurora 1.0.0-alpha.24 (`@plone/plate` 1.0.0-alpha.27): wiki pages store their Plate document in the `main` region with `@type: plate`, and are documented for agents in `@blocks-schema`. Added on-demand visual regression snapshots of the wiki blocks and tables (`make visual-baseline` / `make visual-compare`). @sneridagh